<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντην</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντί</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>against, over against,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ μιν ἔγωγε φεύξομαι . . ἀλλὰ μάλ᾽
				ἄ. στήσομαι</span> I will <i>confront</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.307
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.590
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοιωθήμεναι ἄ.</span> match
			himself <i>openly against</i> me, <i><span class="en">
				1.187
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.120
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πειρηθήμεναι ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.213
				</span></i>
			; more rarely with Verbs of motion, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽
				ἔα ἄ. ἔρχεσθαι</span>
			<i>straightforwards,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν τρέπε,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				11.8.399
			</span></i>; also 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. βαλλομένων</span>”
				<i>in front,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.152
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ τις ἔτλη ἄ.
			εἰσιδέειν</span> look him <i>in the face,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				19.15
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				24.223
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. λοέσσομαι</span> will bathe
				<i>before all, openly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.221
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				8.158
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαπαζέμεν ἄ.</span> greet
				<i>in the face of all,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.464
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νείκεσέτ᾽ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.158
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅς <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ</span>,
				εἴρεαι ἄ.</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				15.247
			</span></i>:- <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θεῷ ἐναλίγκιος ἄ.</span>
			like a god <i>in presence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.310
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδόνι εἰκέλη ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.240
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντα.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Prep. c. gen., only in
			late 
				Ep.
			, as <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				474
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.210
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
